<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Alembeela wa Idi | Hekima na Utamaduni</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-deep: #03070a;
            --bg-card: #0a1118;
            --bg-hover: #101a24;
            --accent-gold: #f3b730;
            --accent-gold-glow: rgba(243, 183, 48, 0.15);
            --text-main: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #8b9bb4;
            --border-color: rgba(243, 183, 48, 0.25);
            --btn-red: #d90429;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-deep);
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(243, 183, 48, 0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);
        }

        /* Navigation Bar */
        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            max-width: 1150px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
        }

        .nav-logo-area {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        /* AI Logo Badge Design matching your brand reference */
        .ai-logo-badge {
            width: 55px;
            height: 55px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 2px solid var(--accent-gold);
            background: radial-gradient(circle, #221c08 0%, #080b0e 100%);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            box-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--accent-gold-glow);
            position: relative;
        }

        .ai-logo-badge .ai-letters {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .ai-logo-badge .ai-subtext {
            font-size: 0.45rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-main);
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-top: 1px;
        }

        .nav-brand-title {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--text-main);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.8rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a.active {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
        }

        .btn-nav-action {
            background: rgba(243, 183, 48, 0.1);
            color: var(--accent-gold) !important;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 0.55rem 1.3rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-nav-action:hover {
            background: var(--accent-gold);
            color: #000 !important;
        }

        /* Hero Header */
        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 4rem 1.5rem 3rem;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 30%, #b0bec5 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* Main Container */
        .container {
            max-width: 1050px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 1.5rem 6rem;
        }

        /* Section Titles */
        .section-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }

        .section-header h2 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--text-main);
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            display: inline-block;
            position: relative;
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .section-header h2::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 45px;
            height: 2px;
            background-color: var(--accent-gold);
        }

        /* Grid Layout */
        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(310px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        /* Card Styles */
        .card {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 2.2rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            position: relative;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--border-color);
            background-color: var(--bg-hover);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 20px var(--accent-gold-glow);
        }

        .card-tag {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .card h3 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        /* Video Action Button */
        .btn-play {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            background: var(--btn-red);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.8rem 1.6rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(217, 4, 41, 0.3);
            width: 100%;
        }

        .btn-play:hover {
            transform: scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(217, 4, 41, 0.5);
            background: #ef233c;
        }

        .play-icon {
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--btn-red);
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            padding-left: 2px;
        }

        /* About Section */
        .about-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .about-card h3 {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .about-card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* Footer Styles */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2.5rem 1rem;
            background-color: #010305;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav-links {
                display: none;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Navigation Bar -->
    <nav>
        <div class="nav-logo-area">
            <div class="ai-logo-badge">
                <span class="ai-letters">AI</span>
                <span class="ai-subtext">AI</span>
            </div>
            <div class="nav-brand-title">Alembeela wa Idi</div>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#" class="active">Home</a>
            <a href="#">Mafunzo</a>
            <a href="#">Kulimishana</a>
            <a href="#" class="btn-nav-action">Tazama Video</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header Section -->
    <header>
        <h1>Hekima &amp; Utamaduni</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">Alembeela wa Idi</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Section Content -->
    <div class="container">
        
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>Úmbo cha Babembe</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
            <!-- Video Part 1 -->
            <div class="card">
                <div>
                    <div class="card-tag">Sehemu ya Kwanza</div>
                    <h3>Úmbo cha Babembe (1)</h3>
                    <p>Uchambuzi maalum na mafunzo ya kina kuhusu asili, historia na utamaduni.</p>
                </div>
                <a href="#" class="btn-play">
                    <div class="play-icon">&#9658;</div>
                    Tazama Video
                </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Video Part 2 -->
            <div class="card">
                <div>
                    <div class="card-tag">Sehemu ya Pili</div>
                    <h3>Úmbo cha Babembe (2)</h3>
                    <p>Mwendelezo wa mafunzo ya kipekee yanayotoa mwanga na maarifa thabiti.</p>
                </div>
                <a href="#" class="btn-play">
                    <div class="play-icon">&#9658;</div>
                    Tazama Video
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>Kulimishana &amp; Kuishi Vizuri</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card">
            <h3>Kuelimisha Jamii na Kujenga Maisha Bora</h3>
            <p>Misingi mikuu ya kuelimishana, kukuza amani, upendo, na kuishi vizuri kupitia hekima na mafunzo thabiti ya kijamii.</p>
        </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Footer Section -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Alembeela wa Idi. Haki zote zimehifadhiwa.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
